# {{name}}

A serge app made by `hyve init --template serge-app`.

```sh
hyve preview --web      # the browser build at http://127.0.0.1:8080/, reloaded on save
hyve preview --native   # the desktop window
hyve build              # the optimized web bundle and desktop binary
```

`hyve preview` runs serge's tool, `hyve-serge`: `cargo install serge-cli --version ={{serge}}`.
The browser build also needs `rustup target add wasm32-unknown-unknown` and
`cargo install wasm-bindgen-cli --version ={{wasm_bindgen}}`.
